  "_comment": "Opted-in integrations for batch publish. Defaults mirror reusable_on_release.yaml. '{tag}' in schema URLs is replaced with the release tag. Optional per-repo fields: app_name (default nri-<integration>), marker_arch (arch of the tarball used to detect a published version, default amd64). verified=true means the settings were checked against the repo's own release workflow on GitHub. Not included: nri-discovery (GitHub binary only) and newrelic-prometheus-exporters-packages (custom-local schema generated per exporter).",
